        1482,
        1416
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "There is hereby created the position of Special Counsel to the Mayor for the Fiscal Oversight of Education (hereafter \"Special Counsel\"), whose duty it shall be to oversee the budgetary procedures and finances of the Board of Education of the City of New York and of the overall City School District of the City of New York. The Special Counsel shall be a Special Deputy Commissioner of the Department of Investigation, and shall receive no compensation, other than reimbursement for actual and necessary expenses incurred in carrying out the duties of the position.",
